  diseaseId: gallbladder
  diseaseName: "SAFRA KESES\u0130 HASTALI\u011EI"
  generalInfo: "Safra kesesi hastal\u0131klar\u0131, safra ak\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131n
    bozulmas\u0131 veya ta\u015F olu\u015Fumu ile geli\u015Fen sindirim sistemi hastal\u0131klar\u0131d\u0131r.
    Hastalarda \xFCst kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131, bulant\u0131 ve yemek sonras\u0131
    rahats\u0131zl\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "\xDCst kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 var olmas\u0131, bulant\u0131
    var olmas\u0131, a\u011Fr\u0131 sa\u011F omuza yay\u0131l\u0131yor olmas\u0131
    ve yemek sonras\u0131 \u015Fi\u015Fkinlik var olmas\u0131 safra kesesi hastal\u0131klar\u0131nda
    s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir."
